// The operator's own workspace, deliberately outside the repository's root
// go.work. Workspace mode resolves one version of every shared dependency
// across its modules; joined there, the Kubernetes libraries' gRPC and
// protobuf versions would be unified with sdk/go's, and the SDK would be
// tested against versions its users never get. Alone here, each module keeps
// the versions its own go.mod names.
go 1.25.6

use .
